# Exception handling and API behavior

Controllers today may return **`NotFound()`** directly. When introducing **shared exception handling** (middleware or filters):

- **Not found:** Subtype of a common **NotFound** exception (or per-entity types) → **404**.
- **Validation / bad input:** **ValidationException** or **ProblemDetails** with field errors → **400**.
- **Unauthorized / forbidden:** use auth result or dedicated types → **401** / **403**.

Decorate actions with **`[MapExceptionToStatusCode(typeof(TException), StatusCodes.…)]`** (or equivalent) when using attribute-driven mapping so handler-thrown types do not become **500**.

See **new-endpoint-exception-mapping** when adding endpoints.
